zzle. Lorsque vous voulez le ranger, gonflez le rouleau et enroulez le tapis autour. Les 3 attaches \u00e9lastiques permettent de tenir le rouleau bien ferm\u00e9. Pas de perte de pi\u00e8ces, pas de perte de place !<\/p>\n<p>Contenu<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>1 tapis de feutre anti-glisse (150 x 100 cm)<\/li>\n<li>1 rouleau gonflable<\/li>\n<li>3 \u00e9lastiques de fixation<\/li>\n<\/ul>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"4490","regular_price":"4490","sale_price":"4490","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"CHF","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span>44.90<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":16280,"src":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/Tapis-de-puzzle-XXL-1000-a-3000-pieces_001_PetitCaribou.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/Tapis-de-puzzle-XXL-1000-a-3000-pieces_001_PetitCaribou-278x278.png","srcset":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/Tapis-de-puzzle-XXL-1000-a-3000-pieces_001_PetitCaribou.png 1000w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/Tapis-de-puzzle-XXL-1000-a-3000-pieces_001_PetitCaribou-278x278.png 278w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/Tapis-de-puzzle-XXL-1000-a-3000-pieces_001_PetitCaribou-100x100.png 100w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/Tapis-de-puzzle-XXL-1000-a-3000-pieces_001_PetitCaribou-501x501.png 501w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/Tapis-de-puzzle-XXL-1000-a-3000-pieces_001_PetitCaribou-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/Tapis-de-puzzle-XXL-1000-a-3000-pieces_001_PetitCaribou-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/up