"name":"Marque","taxonomy":"pa_marque","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":1382,"name":"Ravensburger","slug":"ravensburger"}]},{"id":4,"name":"Type de jeux","taxonomy":"pa_type-de-jeux","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":402,"name":"Puzzles","slug":"puzzles"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":2,"stock_availability":{"text":"2 en stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Tapis de puzzle XXL 1000 \u00e0 3000 pi\u00e8ces&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=30&#038;per_page=100&#038;add-to-cart=16272","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":2,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{"gtm4wp":{"item":{"internal_id":16272,"item_id":"16272","item_name":"Tapis de puzzle XXL 1000 \u00e0 3000 pi\u00e8ces","sku":"1410","price":44.9,"stocklevel":2,"stockstatus":"instock","google_business_vertical":"retail","item_category":"Loisirs cr\u00e9atifs","id":"16272"}}},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/16272","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=25036,16271"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=16272&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":16271,"name":"Tapis de puzzle 300 \u00e0 1500 pi\u00e8ces","slug":"tapis-de-puzzle-300-a-1500-pieces","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/produit\/tapis-de-puzzle-300-a-1500-pieces\/","sku":"1409","short_description":"<p>Le tapis de puzzle offre une surface de travail suffisante pour des motifs jusqu&#8217;\u00e0 1500 pi\u00e8ces. On r\u00e9alise le puzzle directement sur la feutrine anti-d\u00e9rapante. Pour ranger le puzzle, il suffit d&#8217;assembler les tubes en plastique, d&#8217;enrouler le support avec votre puzzle personnalis\u00e9 autour des tubes et de fixer le tout avec les bandes \u00e9lastiques.<\/p>","description":"<p>Le tapis de puzzle est \u00e0 la fois un support et un accessoire de rangement tr\u00e8s pratique pour votre puzzle personnalis\u00e9: confectionn\u00e9 en feutrine, il est anti-d\u00e9rapant et fournit un support parfait pour r\u00e9aliser le puzzle. En outre, le tapis permet de transporter en toute s\u00e9curit\u00e9 le puzzle en cours ou termin\u00e9 et de le ranger sans prendre trop de place.<\/p>\n<p>Le tapis de puzzle offre une surface de travail suffisante pour des motifs jusqu&#8217;\u00e0 1500 pi\u00e8ces. On r\u00e9alise le puzzle directement sur la feutrine anti-d\u00e9rapante. Pour ranger le puzzle, il suffit d&#8217;assembler les tubes en plastique, d&#8217;enrouler le support avec votre puzzle personnalis\u00e9 autour des tubes et de fixer le tout avec les bandes \u00e9lastiques.<\/p>\n<p>Contenu:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>1 tapis anti-d\u00e9rapant en feutrine (110 x 66 cm) pour puzzle jusqu&#8217;\u00e0 1500 pi\u00e8ces<\/li>\n<li>1 tube de plastique robuste \u00e0 assembler<\/li>\n<li>2 bandes \u00e9lastiques pour maintenir le tapis enroul\u00e9<\/li>\n<\/ul>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2590","regular_price":"2590","sale_price":"2590","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"CHF","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span>25.90<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1627