arties de route : quatre courbes, deux parties droites (passage pour pi\u00e9tons et parking) et deux parties de routes crois\u00e9es.<\/p>\n<p>Les pi\u00e8ces de route waytoplay sont imprim\u00e9es des deux c\u00f4t\u00e9s. \u00c0 ajouter \u00e0 vos jeux waytoplay pour encore plus de plaisir. Il suffit d&#8217;agrandir votre autoroute waytoplay avec six parties de route.<\/p>\n<p>Age: d\u00e8s 2 ans<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2990","regular_price":"2990","sale_price":"2990","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"CHF","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span>29.90<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":15153,"src":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/Waytoplay-Extension-Mixed_001_PetitCaribou.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/Waytoplay-Extension-Mixed_001_PetitCaribou-278x278.png","srcset":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/Waytoplay-Extension-Mixed_001_PetitCaribou.png 1000w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/Waytoplay-Extension-Mixed_001_PetitCaribou-278x278.png 278w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/Waytoplay-Extension-Mixed_001_PetitCaribou-100x100.png 100w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/Waytoplay-Extension-Mixed_001_PetitCaribou-501x501.png 501w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/Waytoplay-Extension-Mixed_001_PetitCaribou-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/Waytoplay-Extension-Mixed_001_PetitCaribou-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/Waytoplay-Extension-Mixed_001_Pet