},{"id":23,"name":"Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"francais"},{"id":92,"name":"Italien","slug":"italien"}]},{"id":6,"name":"Marque","taxonomy":"pa_marque","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":466,"name":"Geomag","slug":"geomag"}]},{"id":3,"name":"Origine","taxonomy":"pa_origine","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":113,"name":"Suisse","slug":"suisse"}]},{"id":4,"name":"Type de jeux","taxonomy":"pa_type-de-jeux","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":398,"name":"B\u00e9b\u00e9","slug":"bebe"},{"id":399,"name":"Jeux de construction","slug":"jeux-de-construction"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":1,"stock_availability":{"text":"1 en stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Shapes GREEN line Animals 9 Pi\u00e8ces&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=30&#038;per_page=100&#038;add-to-cart=14373","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":1,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{"gtm4wp":{"item":{"internal_id":14373,"item_id":"14373","item_name":"Shapes GREEN line Animals 9 Pi\u00e8ces","sku":"1230","price":23.9,"stocklevel":1,"stockstatus":"instock","google_business_vertical":"retail","item_category":"Jouets & B\u00e9b\u00e9","id":"14373"}}},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/14373","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=14372,14374,14375"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=14373&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":5361,"name":"Bon Cadeau 30.-","slug":"bon-cadeau-30","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/produit\/bon-cadeau-30\/","sku":"573","short_description":"<p>Vous ne savez pas quoi offrir? Un bon Cadeau est toujours le bienvenu. Ce bon contient une jolie carte avec illustration faite par une artiste<\/p>","description":"<p>Vous ne savez pas quoi offrir?<\/p>\n<p>Un bon Cadeau est toujours le bienvenu<\/p>\n<p>Sur votre Bon figure un code valable sur le site internet lepetitcaribou.spoutnik.org<\/p>\n<p>Vous ne souhaitez commander qu\u2019un bon cadeau? S\u00e9lectionnez\u00a0Point de vente sous exp\u00e9dition lors de votre commande. Nous vous offrons les frais d&#8217;envoi.<\/p>\n<p>Ce bon est valable 12 mois d\u00e8s la date d&#8217;\u00e9mission<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Voil\u00e0 Quelques Phrases pour accompagner votre bon:<\/p>\n<ul class=\"list\">\n<li>&#8220;Le bonheur le plus doux est celui qu&#8217;on partage&#8221;- Jacques Delille<\/li>\n<li>&#8220;Soyons reconnaissants aux personnes qui nous donnent du bonheur ; elles sont les charmants jardiniers par qui nos \u00e2mes sont fleuries&#8221; &#8211; Marcel Proust<\/li>\n<li>&#8220;Personne ne peut m&#8217;offrir de plus beau cadeau que celui de me sentir aim\u00e9e&#8221;-\u00a0Mercia Tweedale<\/li>\n<li>\u00a0&#8220;Le cadeau, dira-t-on, n&#8217;a rien de somptueux, mais venant d&#8217;un ami, tout nous est pr\u00e9cieux&#8221;- Th\u00e9ocrite<\/li>\n<li>&#8220;La fa\u00e7on dont il est donn\u00e9 a plus de valeur que le cadeau&#8221;- Pierre Corneille<\/li>\n<li>&#8220;Chaque jour apporte ses cadeaux. Il ne vous reste qu&#8217;\u00e0 les d\u00e9baller&#8221;-\u00a0Ann Ruth Schabacker<\/li>\n<li>\u201cNa\u00eetre, c&#8217;est recevoir tout un univers en cadeau.\u201d &#8211;\u00a0 Jostein Gaarder<\/li>\n<\/ul>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"3000","regular_price":"3000","sale_price":"3000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"CHF","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span>30.00<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":5365,"src":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou-278x278.png","srcset":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou.png 1000w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou-278x278.png 278w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou-100x100.png 100w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou-501x501.png 501w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou-32x32.png 32w","sizes":"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou-278x278.png 278w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou-100x100.png 100w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou-501x501.png 501w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou-32x32.png 32w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou.png 1000w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 278px) 100vw, 278px","name":"Bon-cadeau_001_PetitCaribou","alt":"Bon cadeau Petit Caribou"}],"categories":[{"id":1614,"name":"Accessoires","slug":"accessoires","link":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/categorie-produit\/accessoires\/"}],"tags":[{"id":333,"name":"Anniversaire","slug":"anniversaire","link":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/etiquette-produit\/anniversaire\/"},{"id":720,"name":"Bon Cadeau","slug":"bon-cadeau","link":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/etiquette-produit\/bon-cadeau\/"},{"id":338,"name":"Cadeau","slug":"cadeau","link":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/etiquette-produit\/cadeau\/"},{"id":725,"name":"F\u00eate","slug":"fete","link":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/etiquette-produit\/fete\/"},{"id":723,"name":"Naissance","slug":"naissance","link":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/etiquette-produit\/naissance\/"},{"id":724,"name":"No\u00ebl","slug":"noel","link":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/etiquette-produit\/noel\/"}],"brands":[],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Ajouter au panier","description":"Ajouter au panier\u00a0: &ldquo;Bon Cadeau 30.-&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?search=30&#038;per_page=100&#038;add-to-cart=5361","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{"gtm4wp":{"item":{"internal_id":5361,"item_id":"5361","item_name":"Bon Cadeau 30.-","sku":"573","price":30,"stocklevel":null,"stockstatus":"instock","google_business_vertical":"retail","item_category":"Accessoires","id":"5361"}}},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/5361","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=5364,5360,5362"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=5361&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":2550,"name":"Magicube Creative Set 8 pcs","slug":"animaux-polaires","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/produit\/animaux-polaires\/","sku":"330","short_description":"<p>MAGICUBE &#8211; Le syst\u00e8me de construction magn\u00e9tique avec les cubes magiques. 8 cubes magn\u00e9tiques et 2 cartes avec 4 motifs diff\u00e9rents pour d\u00e9couvrir le monde captivant du magn\u00e9tisme. 10 pi\u00e8ces. \u00c0 partir de 18 mois. GEOMAG &#8211; Made in Switzerland.<br \/>\nAge: 18 mois<\/p>","description":"<p>MAGICUBE &#8211; Le syst\u00e8me de construction magn\u00e9tique avec les cubes magiques. 8 cubes magn\u00e9tiques et 2 cartes avec 4 motifs diff\u00e9rents pour d\u00e9couvrir le monde captivant du magn\u00e9tisme. 10 pi\u00e8ces. \u00c0 partir de 18 mois. GEOMAG &#8211; Made in Switzerland.<br \/>\nAge: 18 mois<\/p>\n<p>Gr\u00e2ce au magn\u00e9tisme, les cubes peuvent \u00eatre attach\u00e9s facilement sur tous les c\u00f4t\u00e9s.<\/p>\n<p>Dans un premier temps, votre enfant va s&#8217;amuser \u00e0 empiler les cuber sans ordre pr\u00e9cis, puis, au fil du temps, vous pourrez lui apprendre \u00e0 reproduire ce qu&#8217;il voit.<\/p>\n<p>Le syst\u00e8me de construction magn\u00e9tique pour les enfants de 18 mois est vraiment magique. Ce jeu permet le d\u00e9veloppement visuel et la motricit\u00e9 fine des tout-petits et stimule leur cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9<\/p>\n<p>Un syst\u00e8me nouveau de construction magn\u00e9tique qui change le jeu classique des cubes et le fait devenir magique. Les cubes peuvent \u00eatre attach\u00e9s sur tous les c\u00f4t\u00e9s, et les structures sont surprenantes et faciles \u00e0 cr\u00e9er. La gamme <strong>Magicube<\/strong> a \u00e9t\u00e9 d\u00e9velopp\u00e9e pour deux groupes d&#8217;\u00e2ge sp\u00e9cifiques: 1 1\/2 et 3+<\/p>\n<p><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2390","regular_price":"2390","sale_price":"2390","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"CHF","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span>23.90<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":25561,"src":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/Magicube-Creative-Set-8-pcs_001_PetitCaribou.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/Magicube-Creative-Set-8-pcs_001_PetitCaribou-278x278.png","srcset":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/Magicube-Creative-Set-8-pcs_001_PetitCaribou.png 1000w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/Magicube-Creative-Set-8-pcs_001_PetitCaribou-278x278.png 278w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/Magicube-Creative-Set-8-pcs_001_PetitCaribou-100x100.png 100w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/Magicube-Creative-Set-8-pcs_001_PetitCaribou-501x501.png 501w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/Magicube-Creative-Set-8-pcs_001_PetitCaribou-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/Magicube-Creative-Set-8-pcs_001_Pe